mod34_description=Fendt 700 Vario Gen7\nPrice: 192.000 $ - 351.252 $\nPower: 203 - 303hp\n\nEngine configuration:\nFendt 720 Vario Gen7 (203 hp)\nFendt 722 Vario Gen7 (223 hp)\nFendt 724 Vario Gen7 (243 hp)\nFendt 726 Vario Gen7 (262 hp)\nFendt 728 Vario Gen7 (303 hp)\n\nConfigurations:\n- Base Color\n- Rim Color\n- Roof Color\n- Additional Rim Color\n- Wheel weights\n- Line\n- Beacon Lights\n- Warning Signs\n- Cabin\n- Designpackage\n- Roof terminal\n- Front PTO\n- Crop sensors (Precision Farming needed)\n- Animations (Interactive Control needed)\n- GPS (Guidance Steering needed)\n\nAnimations:\n- The door can be opened/closed by pressing both mouse buttons and left/right movement\n- The rear window can be opened/closed by pressing both mouse buttons and forward/backward movement\n- The roof window can be opened/closed with the mouse wheel\n\nChangelog 1.0.0.1:\n- PTO Power fixed\n- smaller Bugfixes
